# DeepAbyssHive – Compile Rescue Batch G (focused on current errors)

intent:
  Make the project compile by adding compatibility partials, fixing enum/int mismatches,
  disambiguating TerrainType, and aligning ServiceLocator & ResourceCost usage expected by managers.

notes:
  - All new files are *.Compat.partial.cs or *.Extensions.cs to stay low-risk and reversible.
  - If a target already exists, keep the existing one; do not duplicate types/namespaces.
  - Prefer fully-qualified names to avoid namespace ambiguity.
  - After each section, rebuild to surface the next smallest set of errors.

